{
  "dom_id": "step-534135",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Solving a Radical Equation When the Radical Is Not Isolated",
  "problem": "Solve $\\sqrt{x^2-5x+8} -2 = 0.$",
  "worked_solution": "First, we isolate the square root by adding $2$ to both sides:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-5x+8}-2 & =0 \\\\ \\sqrt{{x}^{2}-5x+8} & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the square root is isolated, we can proceed as usual. Squaring both sides of the equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-5x+8})}^{2} & ={(2)}^{2} \\\\ {x}^{2}-5x+8 & =4 \\\\ {x}^{2}-5x+4 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}-4x-x+4 & =0 \\\\ (x-4)(x-1) & =0 \\\\ x=4,1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's check the results by plugging them into the original equation.\n\n- For $x=1,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{{1}^{2}-5(1)+8}-2 & \\overset{?}{=}0 \\\\ \\sqrt{4} & \\overset{?}{=}2 \\\\ 2 & =2.\\,\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $x=4,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{{4}^{2}-5(4)+8}-2 & \\overset{?}{=}0 \\\\ \\sqrt{4} & \\overset{?}{=}2 \\\\ 2 & =2.\\,\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBoth $x=1$ and $x=4$ satisfy the original equation, so we can accept them both as solutions.\n\nTherefore, the solutions to $\\sqrt{x^2-5x+8} -2 = 0$ are $x=1$ and $x=4.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-534135\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"534135\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"5234\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-534135\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-9\">Solving a Radical Equation When the Radical Is Not Isolated</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"534135\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n    